{"root":"gentar","ipa":"/ɡəntar/","core":"指因恐惧、不安或受到威胁而产生的颤抖、战栗或惊恐感。","pos":["名词","动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ɡəntar/","zh":"战栗，惊恐，颤抖","phrases":[{"t":"gentar hati","zh":"心惊胆战"},{"t":"tanpa gentar","zh":"毫不畏惧"},{"t":"rasa gentar","zh":"恐惧感"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia tidak merasa gentar sedikit pun menghadapi tantangan itu.","zh":"面对那个挑战，他一点也没有感到畏惧。"},{"t":"Suaranya bergetar karena gentar.","zh":"他的声音因为恐惧而颤抖。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"gentar","ipa":"/ɡəntar/","zh":"战栗，惊恐","phrase":{"t":"gentar menghadapi musuh","zh":"面对敌人感到恐惧"},"example":{"t":"Jangan gentar untuk mencoba hal baru.","zh":"不要害怕尝试新事物。"}},{"w":"menggentarkan","ipa":"/məŋɡəntarkan/","zh":"使人战栗，使人惊恐，令人畏惧","phrase":{"t":"suara yang menggentarkan","zh":"令人战栗的声音"},"example":{"t":"Berita itu menggentarkan seluruh penduduk kota.","zh":"那个消息使全城居民感到惊恐。"}},{"w":"kegentaran","ipa":"/kəɡəntaran/","zh":"恐惧，惊恐状态","phrase":{"t":"rasa kegentaran","zh":"恐惧感"},"example":{"t":"Kegentaran tampak jelas di wajahnya.","zh":"恐惧感清晰地写在他的脸上。"}}],"derSlugs":["gentar","menggentarkan","kegentaran"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:46:06.008Z","src":"base"}